1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,801
The most-watched debut in K-pop history was missing someone.

2
00:00:03,801 --> 00:00:08,324
Three years later, the missing one is the reason nobody can stop watching.

3
00:00:08,324 --> 00:00:09,652
She is nineteen.

4
00:00:09,652 --> 00:00:10,914
The dome is open.

5
00:00:10,914 --> 00:00:19,858
And the story, as her fans like to say — the ones who waited, the ones who never stopped asking where she was — is very much still being written.

